== Trivia ==
* ''Wavy Cap'' originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and was called [[anti:Black Mushroom|Black Mushroom]]. By extension, it was also from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Community Remix'', its effects were permanent, always had an instant recharge time, and did not have any screen distortion effects.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* Since the fire rate increase is flat, it is technically possible to reach the hard cap of 120.0 with enough uses. In practice this renders the game unplayable due to distortion.
* The distortion effect applied to Isaac is very similar to the one seen in ''[[wikipedia:Yoshi's Island|Yoshi's Island]]'' when touching a Fuzzy.
* On final stages of the distortion, the wave effect will appear to make parts of the top of the screen on the lower screen and the lower screen on top of the screen, while bright colors dance on the screen, similar to how psychedelic trips are described.
* Wavy Cap, also known as ''[[wikipedia:Psilocybe cyanescens|Psilocybe cyanescens]],''  is a species of potent psychedelic mushroom.

